Do's

-   Think before posting; make sure your content is respectful and
    appropriate.
-   Check privacy settings on your social media accounts regularly.
-   Verify information before sharing news, links, or screenshots.
-   Use strong passwords and enable two‑factor authentication for your
    accounts.
-   Report fake accounts, harassment, or suspicious activity on the
    platform.

## Don'ts

-   Don't share personal information like your address, phone number, or
    bank details publicly.
-   Don't post offensive, abusive, or harmful comments about others.
-   Don't spread rumors, fake news, or unverified information.
-   Don't click unknown links sent through direct messages or comments.
-   Don't post photos or videos of others without their permission.

